-- Job-aware Playful lines: one witty persona per job, with the
-- same structure as the Bard Playful set (middles/openers/closers
-- per category, same counts). BRD reuses the existing Playful
-- tables above, so the Bard lines live in exactly one place.
-- get_random_line picks the table for the player's current main
-- job and falls back to BRD for any job without a table.
