    RDM = {
        middles = {
            engage = { 'That {mob} just met a mage with a sword. Oops.', 'I heal, I nuke, I fence. Pick your doom.', 'Enfeebles first, sword second, mercy never.', 'That {mob} is about to learn versatility hurts.', 'Sword in one hand, spell in the other. Balance.', 'I do not need a specialist. I am the specialist.', 'Fast cast, faster sword, fastest wit in Vana.', 'That {mob} picked the wrong jack of all trades.', 'Refresh is on, blade is out, jokes are loaded.', 'I can heal and hurt. Today I choose hurt.', 'That {mob} just got scheduled for a debuff spa.', 'Red mage, red cape, red flags for that {mob}.', 'I convert HP to MP and MP to your problem.', 'That {mob} has no idea what hit it yet.', 'One mage, four jobs, zero patience for that {mob}.', 'Enfeeble, stab, repeat. It is a lifestyle.', 'I am the whole party in one very stylish hat.', 'That {mob} is now my least favorite student.', 'Swordplay and sorcery, served at the same time.', 'I did not come to specialize. I came to win.', 'That {mob} looks slow already. Let me help.', 'Chainspell is warming up and so am I.', 'I heal the party and humble the {mob}. Multitask.', 'That {mob} just volunteered for a magic lesson.', 'Fencer, nuker, healer, debuffer. All me, all now.', 'My sword is sharp and my spellbook is sharper.', 'That {mob} is about to be outclassed in everything.', 'I do everything. That {mob} does nothing well.', 'Watch me do four jobs at once, {mob}.', 'That {mob} is in for a very educational beating.', 'I am not a healer. I am not a nuker. I am both.', 'Enfeebles incoming. That {mob} will feel useless soon.', 'My rapier and my magic agree: that {mob} loses.', 'That {mob} chose violence with a polymath. Bold.', 'I cast fast, I stab fast, I quip fastest.', 'That {mob} is about to need a specialist. Too bad.', 'Red magic, red blade, red carpet for your defeat.', 'I am the jack of all trades and master of this {mob}.', 'That {mob} just met the entire job system at once.', 'Bats beware: the red mage is here