            idle = { 'Fight won, mana topped, ego still fully charged.', 'I did four jobs and barely broke a sweat. Next.', 'Resting now. Even polymaths need a breather.', 'That was work? I call that a warmup lap.', 'Sword sheathed, spells cooled, wit still hot.', 'I healed, I nuked, I fenced. Lunch break now.', 'Another win for the jack of all trades. Shocking.', 'Mana back, health back, confidence never left.', 'I make multitasking look easy because it is.', 'Rest a moment. Greatness needs a short pause.', 'The {mob} is gone and my hat is still perfect.', 'I did everything again. Someone please notice.', 'Quick rest, then back to being four jobs at once.', 'My sword is clean and my spell list is smug.', 'That fight was a checklist and I ticked it all.', 'Refresh ticking, feet up, reputation intact.', 'I am resting, not retired. Big difference, trust me.', 'Four jobs done, zero specialists harmed. Mostly.', 'Idle now, but my enfeebles are still on standby.', 'That was easy. I barely used my best spells.', 'Time to recharge MP and reload the one liners.', 'I won as healer, nuker, fencer and debuffer. Again.', 'Resting in style. Red mages do not slouch, ever.', 'The dust settles and I am still the versatile one.', 'A short break for the mage who does it all.', 'My blade rests, my magic rests, my ego does not.', 'That {mob} never stood a chance against all of me.', 'I am taking five. The next {mob} can wait in line.', 'Mana full, sword sharp, jokes fully recharged.', 'Even a polymath enjoys a quiet moment. Briefly.', 'Fight over, hat straight, legend still growing.', 'I juggled four roles and dropped none of them.', 'Rest now, conquer later. It is the red mage way.', 'Bats down, mana up, style points maxed out.', 'I call that a light workout with heavy applause.', 'My Refresh is humming and so is my confidence.', 'Another victory filed under things I do daily.', 'I am not tired. I am strategically recharging.', 'The {mob} is history and I am still fabulous.', 'Sit, sip, smirk. The next fight can wait a sec.' },
