            ko = { 'I died, but my versatility died with style, at least.', 'Down I go, still the most talented corpse here.', 'I am dead, but my enfeebles are still judging you.', 'The red mage has fallen. The jokes have not.', 'I died doing four jobs at once. Respect the hustle.', 'Down, not done. A red mage always has a backup plan.', 'I am flat on the floor and still full of opinions.', 'Death got me, but it had to work four times as hard.', 'I died, I admit it, I am still blaming that {mob}.', 'The floor is cold and my pride is colder, {mob}.', 'I am KO and still the best mage in this party.', 'Down I went, sword up, spellbook open, pride intact.', 'I died, but I died versatile, and that counts, right.', 'The {mob} got me this time. It will regret the sequel.', 'I am dead and already planning my dramatic return.', 'Flat on my back, still thinking in four jobs at once.', 'Death is a setback, not a career change for me.', 'I am out cold and still outclassing that {mob} somehow.', 'The red mage is down. Someone fetch a raise, please.', 'I died with full mana and an empty patience meter.', 'Down, defeated, still debating the {mob} technique.', 'I am KO, but my hat stayed perfect. Small victories.', 'Death took me and got a polymath for the price of one.', 'I am gone for now, but my Refresh is still ticking.', 'The floor and I are old friends by now, {mob}.', 'I died, I fell, I am still the funniest one here.', 'Down I go, still a healer, nuker, fencer, debuffer.', 'I am dead, but I died doing everything at once.', 'The {mob} won a round. It will not win the story.', 'KO is just a timeout for a very talented mage.', 'I am flat, finished, still fabulous, somehow.', 'Death is rude, but I am ruder, and I will be back.', 'I fell doing four jobs. That {mob} fell doing one.', 'I am down and still giving that {mob} a bad review.', 'Bats got the best of me. This time. Only this time.', 'I died, but my spellbook is still open for business.', 'The red mage has left the fight.