            low = { 'HP low. My spells are still fully loaded, though.', 'I am hurt, but my fireball is fine. Priorities.', 'Half health, full mana, zero plans to run.', 'That {mob} hit me. Rude. Now it pays in fire.', 'I am at half HP and twice the grudge.', 'My HP is dropping. My damage is rising. Funny.', 'I bleed a little. I nuke a lot. Fair trade.', 'That {mob} scratched the mage. Big mistake, {mob}.', 'HP below half. My aim is still perfect, though.', 'I am wounded, not worried. There is a difference.', 'That hit hurt. My next spell will hurt more.', 'I am down to half. That {mob} is down to seconds.', 'My robes are singed. My temper is fully lit.', 'Ouch. That {mob} just signed its own crater form.', 'HP low, MP high, temper higher. Watch out, {mob}.', 'I took a hit. I will return it with interest and fire.', 'Half HP means half the mage to hit. Good luck, {mob}.', 'That {mob} thinks it is winning. Adorable. Wrong.', 'I am hurt and hilarious. A dangerous combination.', 'My health bar is shy. My spellbook is not.', 'That {mob} drew first blood. I draw last thunder.', 'I am at half health and full sarcasm capacity.', 'A scratch, a spell, and suddenly that {mob} is sorry.', 'HP dropping fast. Jokes dropping faster. Nukes fastest.', 'I am not dying. I am just dramatically half alive.', 'That {mob} hit hard. My revenge hits harder.', 'Half HP, all mage, no mercy left in stock.', 'I wobble a bit. My aim does not wobble at all.', 'That bat got lucky once. Once is all it gets.', 'My HP is low but my thunder is fully charged.', 'I am hurt, I am grinning, I am still casting.', 'That {mob} wants me down. I want it dust. Deal.', 'Low HP is just my dramatic entrance to winning.', 'I am bleeding and still the smartest one here.', 'That hit stung. The fireball will sting more.', 'Half health, zero fear, one very angry mage.', 'My HP bar is small. My explosion radius is not.', 'I am down but my spells are up. That is what counts.', 'That {mob} made me bleed. Now I make it cr