            critical = { 'HP critical. My jokes are the only thing still standing.', 'I am nearly dead and still funnier than that {mob}.', 'One more hit and I am a ghost with great aim.', 'My HP is a rumor at this point. My spells are real.', 'That {mob} almost got me. Almost. Key word.', 'I am at a quarter HP and full menace.', 'Critical HP, critical wit, critical fireball incoming.', 'I can see the light. It looks flammable. Good.', 'That {mob} thinks I am done. I am just getting warm.', 'My health is low. My dramatic timing is perfect.', 'I am one sneeze from dead and still casting.', 'HP in the red, mage in the zone, {mob} in trouble.', 'I am nearly a crater myself. Not yet, though.', 'That {mob} wants a kill. I want a punchline and a nuke.', 'My HP bar is basically a dotted line now.', 'I am hanging on by one HP and a thousand jokes.', 'Critical does not mean quiet. It means louder spells.', 'That {mob} hit me hard. My comeback hits harder.', 'I am nearly dead, but my thunder is fully alive.', 'If I die, I die mid-cast. That is the mage way.', 'My HP is tiny. My explosion is not, {mob}.', 'I am near death and still roasting that {mob}.', 'One HP left would still be enough for one fireball.', 'That {mob} is about to kill a legend. Try it.', 'I am critical, I am cranky, I am still casting.', 'My health is gone. My attitude stayed behind.', 'That bat nearly ended me. Nearly. I hold grudges.', 'I am running on fumes and pure spite now.', 'HP critical. Sarcasm levels remain dangerously high.', 'I refuse to die before that {mob} does. Simple rule.', 'My body is failing. My spellbook is thriving.', 'That {mob} can smell fear. It smells my fireball instead.', 'I am nearly dead and the jokes keep coming. Weird.', 'Critical HP means my best material comes out now.', 'I am a quarter mage and a whole disaster for that {mob}.', 'Death is close. My thunder is closer, {mob}.', 'I am barely standing and still the biggest threat here.', 'My HP is a joke. My damage is the punchline, {mob}.', 'That {mob} almost wins. Almost is not winning.', 'I am too stubborn to die before that {mob} does.' },
            recover = { 'HP is back. The mage is back. The {mob} is still doomed.', 'I am back up and my aim never left.', 'Back above half. Back to blowing things up.', 'My health returned. My grudge never left.', 'I feel alive again. That {mob} will not for long.', 'HP recovered. Jokes recovered. Fireballs reloaded.', 'I am back on my feet and back on the attack.', 'That was a close one. Now watch me return the favor.', 'Health is up. Temper is still up. Spell is ready.', 'I am patched up and twice as dangerous now.', 'Back in the green and already planning the next crater.', 'My HP climbed back. My confidence climbed higher.', 'I survived that. That {mob} will not survive me.', 'Feeling better, casting better, aiming better already.', 'HP restored. The mage menace is fully operational.', 'I am back and my staff missed the action.', 'That low HP phase is over. The payback phase begins.', 'My health bar is healthy again. Unlike that {mob}.', 'I recovered. Now that {mob} gets to recover never.', 'Back to full power. The crater count resumes now.', 'I am back, I am happy, I am hurling fire again.', 'HP is up, MP is up, morale is way up.', 'That was a scare. This next spell is the answer.', 'I am standing tall again. Tall enough to nuke, anyway.', 'Recovery complete. Revenge loading. Please wait, {mob}.', 'My HP is back where it belongs: above my problems.', 'I feel great. That {mob} is about to feel terrible.', 'Back from the brink, straight to the blast zone.', 'That bat hurt me. I am fine now. It is not fine.', 'Health restored, ego restored, staff recharged.', 'I am good as new. That {mob} is good as gone.', 'My HP bounced back. My spells never bounced at all.', 'I am back in action and the action is explosive.', 'That recovery felt great. The next nuke feels greater.', 'I am whole again. That {mob} is about to be holes.', 'HP is healthy. My sense of humor is healthier.', 'I shook that off. That {mob} will not shake me off.', 'Back to business: the business of big numbers.', 'I am recovered and ready to redecorate with craters.', 'Health is back. Let the fireworks resume, {mob}.' },
            ko = { 'I am down. Tell my staff I died mid-cast. Heroic.', 'The mage has fallen. The jokes have not. They never do.', 'I died, but that {mob} is still ugly. Priorities.', 'Down I go. My last thought was a fireball, obviously.', 'I am dead. My spellbook is judging that {mob} hard.', 'The great mage falls. The crater count pauses. Briefly.', 'I died doing what I loved: standing too close to {mob}.', 'That {mob} got me. I want a rematch and a raise.', 'I am on the floor. My dignity is somewhere near my staff.', 'Death took me. It did not take my sense of humor.', 'I am down, but my last spell is still flying, I hope.', 'The mage is KO. The punchlines are on life support.', 'I died. That {mob} is still going to lose. Eventually.', 'Flat on my back, still the funniest corpse here.', 'I got knocked out. My MP bar fainted in sympathy.', 'That {mob} wins this round. I win the rematch, though.', 'I am dead and still annoyed at that {mob}. Impressive.', 'Down goes the mage. Up goes my grudge, somehow.', 'I died mid-joke. Someone finish it for me. Please.', 'The floor is cold. My revenge plans are warm.', 'I am KO. My staff rolled away. It is dramatic like that.', 'That {mob} killed me. I am taking notes from the floor.', 'I died, but I died fashionably. Ask anyone. Ask my staff.', 'The mage has left the fight. Temporarily. Very temporarily.', 'I am down. This is the worst plot twist of the day.', 'Death is just a long rest with extra paperwork.', 'That bat got me. I demand a recount and a raise.', 'I am dead. My thunder is still scheduled, though.', 'The great mage falls, the legend gets better. Somehow.', 'I died standing my ground. Well, lying on it now.', 'KO. My last words were probably a spell name.', 'That {mob} beat me once. Once is its whole highlight.', 'I am out cold. My grudges are wide awake, though.', 'The mage is down. The crater is still pending, {mob}.', 'I died, but my jokes live on. They are immortal, unlike me.', 'Flat out and still funnier than that {mob}. Facts.', 'I am dead. Do not let that {mob} dance on me.', 'That {mob} got lucky. Luck runs out. I do not.', 'I am KO and already planning my comeback spell.', 'Death paused me. It did not pause my punchlines.' },
            target = { 'New target: that {mob}. New crater: also that {mob}.', 'I see you, {mob}. My staff sees you too.', 'Target acquired. Fireball loading. Goodbye, {mob}.', 'That {mob} just became my favorite target.', 'I have my eye on that {mob}. And my thunder.', 'New {mob} on the list. Same ending as the last one.', 'That {mob} looks like my next big number.', 'I picked that {mob}. My spells picked it too.', 'Target locked. That {mob} is officially in trouble.', 'Hello, {mob}. I am the mage. You are the crater.', 'That {mob} caught my eye. My fireball caught the rest.', 'I choose that {mob}. My staff agrees. It always does.', 'New target, same plan: fire, thunder, crater.', 'That {mob} is next. It does not know it yet.', 'I point my staff at that {mob}. That is never good news.', 'Target spotted. The blast radius is already warming up.', 'That {mob} just walked into my spell range. Bold.', 'I see a {mob} and I see a future crater.', 'New {mob}, who dis? The mage who ends you, that is who.', 'That {mob} is my new project. Project: crater.', 'I locked onto that {mob}. Locking is the easy part.', 'Target: {mob}. Mood: explosive. Forecast: fire.', 'That {mob} has my full attention and my full MP bar.', 'I found the next {mob}. The next {mob} found trouble.', 'Hello, new {mob}. Goodbye, new {mob}. In that order.', 'That {mob} is the next name in my spellbook.', 'I target that {mob}. My thunder targets it too.', 'That bat is next. Bats make excellent craters.', 'New target acquired. Old target is a smoking hole.', 'That {mob} is officially on my bad side now.', 'I see that {mob}. That {mob} sees a mage. Run, {mob}.', 'Target selected. The fireworks are already lit.', 'That {mob} is next in line for a thunderbolt.', 'I have chosen that {mob}. My spells have chosen violence.', 'New {mob}, same ending: a crater with your name on it.', 'That {mob} just got promoted to main target. Congrats.', 'I spy a {mob}. My staff spies a crater.', 'Target locked on that {mob}. Fire when ready. I am ready.', 'That {mob} is my kind of target: flammable and close.', 'I picked that {mob} out of the crowd. Lucky {mob}.' },
            kill = { 'That {mob} is a crater now. You are welcome.', 'Another {mob} down. My spellbook grows bolder.', 'Boom. That {mob} is done. Next, please.', 'That {mob} exploded beautifully. I take full credit.', 'Kill confirmed. The crater is my signature, {mob}.', 'That {mob} is dust. My aim is still perfect.', 'One {mob}, one fireball, one smoking hole. Classic.', 'That {mob} is gone. My MP bar sends its regards.', 'Another big number, another dead {mob}. Lovely.', 'That {mob} is history. I wrote it in fire.', 'Down goes that {mob}. Up goes my kill count.', 'That {mob} tried. That {mob} failed. I nuke.', 'The crater formerly known as {mob}. Nice ring to it.', 'That {mob} is toast. Extra crispy, just how I like it.', 'Kill secured. My thunder did the talking again.', 'That {mob} is a scorch mark with a backstory.', 'Another one bites the dust. And the fire. And the ice.', 'That {mob} is done for. My staff barely warmed up.', 'Boom goes the {mob}. Applause goes to me.', 'That {mob} is now a cautionary tale for its friends.', 'I turned that {mob} into a fine, smoking crater.', 'Kill count up. MP count down. Worth it every time.', 'That {mob} is gone and the ground is still smoking.', 'Another {mob} learned why mages keep their distance.', 'That {mob} is dust and I am still standing, fabulous.', 'The {mob} is no more. The joke writes itself, honestly.', 'That bat is bat-tered. I regret nothing.', 'That {mob} fell to my favorite element: all of them.', 'Kill confirmed, crater certified, mage magnificent.', 'That {mob} is a memory now. A smoking, funny memory.', 'I nuked that {mob} so hard the ground filed a complaint.', 'Another {mob} down. My staff is still hungry, though.', 'That {mob} is finished. My punchlines are not.', 'Boom. Done. That {mob} never stood a chance.', 'That {mob} is ash. My legend grows by one crater.', 'One less {mob}, one more story for the tavern.', 'That {mob} exploded on schedule. I love punctual craters.', 'Kill secured. The smoke spell