            idle = { 'Fight over. Time to set my spells again.', 'That {mob} is done. My spellbook is still hungry.', 'I rest now. My blue magic needs a breather too.', 'Another {mob} down. Another lesson learned.', 'I sit and sort my spells. Monster sorting, I call it.', 'Resting. My spell list is a work in progress.', 'That fight is over. My spell roulette still spins.', 'I take a break. Even monster mages need one.', 'That {mob} is history. I kept the spell, though.', 'I rest my sword. My spells never rest for long.', 'Another win. My blue magic grows stronger.', 'I meditate on monster moves. It is a lifestyle.', 'Sitting down. My spellbook stays wide open.', 'That was fun. I learned three new tricks from it.', 'I rest now. The next {mob} is my next lesson.', 'My MP is low. My spell list is still full.', 'That {mob} is gone. I kept its best move.', 'I take five. My spells take a quick nap too.', 'Rest time. I am still thinking about that {mob}.', 'Another {mob} down. My spell collection grows.', 'I sit, I breathe, I review my monster notes.', 'That bat is toast. I learned its trick anyway.', 'Quiet now. My spells are plotting the next fight.', 'I rest. Blue magic is tiring. Monster magic too.', 'That fight ended. My spell list got longer.', 'I am resting. My blue spells are recharging.', 'Victory and a new spell. Today was a good day.', 'I take a bow. The {mob} takes a nap. Forever.', 'Resting now. My monster homework is never done.', 'That {mob} is dust. My spellbook is heavier.', 'I sit down. Even Azure Lore needs a coffee break.', 'Another lesson learned. Another {mob} down.', 'I rest my feet. My spell set stays sharp.', 'That was a workout. My spells did the heavy lifting.', 'Quiet at last. My spellbook is still buzzing.', 'I recharge. The next monster teaches me more.', 'That fight is done. My blue magic is just warming up.', 'I rest now so the next {mob} can teach me things.', 'Sitting is underrated. Learning spells is not.', 'That {mob} is gone. My spell list remembers it.' },
            low = { 'Half health. My blue magic is still at full power.', 'That {mob} hit me. Rude. It taught me a new grudge.', 'I am hurt, but my spell list is still complete.', 'Half HP, full spell set, zero plans to run.', 'My HP is dropping. My monster moves are rising.', 'That {mob} scratched me. It will regret the lesson.', 'I bleed a little. I cast a lot. Fair trade.', 'HP below half. My spell roulette still spins fine.', 'I am wounded, not done. There is a difference.', 'That hit hurt. My borrowed spell will hurt more.', 'I am down to half. That {mob} is down to one spell.', 'My robes are torn. My spell set is fully intact.', 'Ouch. That {mob} just signed its own lesson plan.', 'HP low, MP high, spell list higher. Watch out, {mob}.', 'I took a hit. I will return it with monster magic.', 'Half HP means I cast twice as fast. Probably.', 'That {mob} thinks it is winning. It is lunch.', 'I am hurt and still learning. A dangerous student.', 'My health bar is shy. My monster moves are not.', 'That {mob} drew first blood. I draw last magic.', 'I am at half health and full spell capacity.', 'A scratch, a spell, and that {mob} is suddenly sorry.', 'HP dropping fast. Spells dropping fastest.', 'I am not dying. I am just dramatically half a monster.', 'That {mob} hit hard. My copied spell hits harder.', 'Half HP, all blue mage, no mercy left in stock.', 'I wobble a bit. My spell set does not wobble at all.', 'That bat got lucky once. I learned its trick anyway.', 'My HP is low but my blue magic is fully charged.', 'I am hurt, I am grinning, I am still learning spells.', 'That {mob} wants me down. I want its spell. Deal.', 'Low HP is just my dramatic entrance to Azure Lore.', 'I am bleeding and still the best student here.', 'That hit stung. The blue spell will sting more.', 'Half health, zero fear, one very hungry mage.', 'My HP bar is small. My spell list is not.', 'I am down but my monster moves are up. That counts.', 'That {mob} made me bleed. Now I make it teach m