            critical = { 'HP critical. My spellbook is still standing.', 'I am nearly dead and still hungrier than that {mob}.', 'One more hit and I am a ghost with great spells.', 'My HP is a rumor. My monster moves are real.', 'That {mob} almost ate me. Almost. Key word.', 'I am at a quarter HP and full monster.', 'Critical HP, critical wit, critical spell incoming.', 'I can see the light. It looks learnable. Good.', 'That {mob} thinks I am done. I am just getting hungry.', 'My health is low. My Azure Lore timing is perfect.', 'I am one sneeze from dead and still learning.', 'HP in the red, spells in the zone, {mob} in trouble.', 'I am nearly a monster myself. Not yet, though.', 'That {mob} wants a kill. I want a spell and a snack.', 'My HP bar is basically a dotted line of spells now.', 'I am hanging on by one HP and a thousand spells.', 'Critical does not mean quiet. It means monster magic.', 'That {mob} hit me hard. My stolen spell hits harder.', 'I am nearly dead, but my blue magic is fully alive.', 'If I die, I die mid-cast. That is the blue mage way.', 'My HP is tiny. My spell list is not, {mob}.', 'I am near death and still copying that {mob}.', 'One HP left would still be enough for one spell.', 'That {mob} is about to kill a student. Try it.', 'I am critical, I am cranky, I am still learning.', 'My health is gone. My spellbook stayed behind.', 'That bat nearly ended me. Nearly. I learned its move.', 'I am running on fumes and pure monster now.', 'HP critical. Spell levels remain dangerously high.', 'I refuse to die before that spell is mine.', 'My body is failing. My monster moves are thriving.', 'That {mob} can smell fear. It smells my spell instead.', 'I am nearly dead and the spells keep coming. Weird.', 'Critical HP means my best spells come out now.', 'I am a quarter mage and a whole monster for that {mob}.', 'Death is close. My blue magic is closer, {mob}.', 'I am barely standing and still the hungriest mage here.', 'My HP is a joke. My spells are t