            recover = { 'HP is back. The blue mage is back. {mob} is doomed.', 'I am back up and my spells never left.', 'Back above half. Back to stealing monster moves.', 'My health returned. My spell list never left.', 'I feel alive again. That {mob} is my next lesson.', 'HP recovered. Spells recovered. Hunger reloaded.', 'I am back on my feet and back to learning spells.', 'That was a close one. Now watch me copy that {mob}.', 'Health is up. Spell list is still up. Hunger is ready.', 'I am patched up and twice as hungry now.', 'Back in the green and already planning the next spell.', 'My HP climbed back. My spell list climbed higher.', 'I survived that. That {mob} will teach me one spell.', 'Feeling better, casting better, learning better.', 'HP restored. The blue mage menace is fully operational.', 'I am back and my spellbook missed the action.', 'That low HP phase is over. The learning phase begins.', 'My health bar is healthy again. That {mob} is homework.', 'I recovered. Now that {mob} gets to rest never.', 'Back to full power. The spell count resumes now.', 'I am back, I am happy, I am learning spells again.', 'HP is up, MP is up, hunger is way up.', 'That was a scare. This next monster move is the answer.', 'I am standing tall again. Tall enough to learn, anyway.', 'Recovery complete. Monster magic loading.', 'My HP is back where it belongs: above my spellbook.', 'I feel great. That {mob} is about to feel copied.', 'Back from the brink, straight to the spell list.', 'That bat hurt me. I am fine now. I learned its move.', 'Health restored, hunger restored, spellbook recharged.', 'I am good as new. That {mob} is good as a lesson.', 'My HP bounced back. My spell list never left at all.', 'I am back in action and the action is monstrous.', 'That recovery felt great. The next spell feels greater.', 'I am whole again. That {mob} is about to be homework.', 'HP is healthy. My hunger for spells is healthier.', 'I shook that off. That {mob} spell will not shake me.'