            ko = { 'I am down. Tell my spellbook I died mid-cast. Heroic.', 'The blue mage has fallen. The spells have not.', 'I died, but that {mob} is still tasty. Priorities.', 'Down I go. My last thought was a monster spell.', 'I am dead. My spell list is judging that {mob} hard.', 'The great blue mage falls. The spells pause. Briefly.', 'I died doing what I loved: eating monsters for spells.', 'That {mob} got me. I want a rematch and its spell.', 'I am on the floor. My spellbook is near my sword.', 'Death took me. It did not take my spell list.', 'I am down, but my last spell is still flying somewhere.', 'The blue mage is KO. The spells are on life support.', 'I died. That {mob} is still going to teach me.', 'Flat on my back, still the hungriest corpse here.', 'I got knocked out. My spellbook fainted in sympathy.', 'That {mob} wins this round. I learn its spell, though.', 'I am dead and still hungry for that {mob} spell.', 'Down goes the blue mage. Up goes my spell list.', 'I died mid-lesson. Someone finish it for me. Please.', 'The floor is cold. My spell plans are warm.', 'I am KO. My spellbook rolled away. So dramatic.', 'That {mob} killed me. I take notes from the floor.', 'I died, but I died fashionably. Ask my spellbook.', 'The blue mage has left the fight. Temporarily.', 'I am down. This is the worst spell lesson of the day.', 'Death is just a long rest with extra homework.', 'That bat got me. I demand a recount and its spell.', 'I am dead. My Azure Lore is still scheduled, though.', 'The great blue mage falls, the spells get better.', 'I died learning my lesson. Well, lying on it now.', 'KO. My last words were probably a monster name.', 'That {mob} beat me once. Once is its whole spellbook.', 'I am out cold. My hunger is wide awake, though.', 'The blue mage is down. The spell is pending, {mob}.', 'I died, but my spell list lives on. It is immortal.', 'Flat out and still hungrier than that {mob}. Facts.', 'I am dead. Do not let that {mob} eat me first.',