            low = { 'HP low. My runes are still fully loaded, though.', 'I am hurt, but my wards are fine. Priorities.', 'Half health, full runes, zero plans to run.', 'That {mob} hit me. Rude. Now it pays in runes.', 'I am at half HP and twice the rune count.', 'My HP is dropping. My wards are rising. Funny.', 'I bleed a little. I ward a lot. Fair trade.', 'That {mob} scratched the tank. Big mistake, {mob}.', 'HP below half. My sword arm is still perfect, though.', 'I am wounded, not wavering. There is a difference.', 'That hit hurt. My next rune will hurt more.', 'I am down to half. That {mob} is down to a ward.', 'My armor is scorched. My temper is fully lit.', 'Ouch. That {mob} just signed its own ward form.', 'HP low, runes high, temper higher. Watch out, {mob}.', 'I took a hit. I will return it with interest and runes.', 'Half HP means half the tank to hit. Good luck, {mob}.', 'That {mob} thinks it is winning. Adorable. Warded.', 'I am hurt and warded. A dangerous combination.', 'My health bar is shy. My rune pouch is not.', 'That {mob} drew first blood. I draw last lightning.', 'I am at half health and full rune capacity.', 'A scratch, a ward, and suddenly that {mob} is sorry.', 'HP dropping fast. Jokes dropping faster. Runes fastest.', 'I am not dying. I am just dramatically half warded.', 'That {mob} hit hard. My runes hit harder.', 'Half HP, all tank, no mercy left in stock.', 'I wobble a bit. My runes do not wobble at all.', 'That bat got lucky once. My wards allow once.', 'My HP is low but my lightning rune is fully charged.', 'I am hurt, I am grinning, I am still warding.', 'That {mob} wants me down. I want it warded. Deal.', 'Low HP is just my dramatic entrance to warding.', 'I am bleeding and still the best warded one here.', 'That hit stung. The next rune will sting more.', 'Half health, zero fear, one very angry tank.', 'My HP bar is small. My ward radius is not.', 'I am down but my runes are up. That is what counts.', 'That {mob} made me bleed. Now