            low = { 'HP low. My fists are still fully loaded, though.', 'I am hurt, but my punch is fine. Priorities.', 'Half health, full fists, zero plans to run.', 'That {mob} hit me. Rude. Now it pays in punches.', 'Half HP left, but my fists hold double the grudge.', 'My HP is dropping. My punches are rising. Funny.', 'I bleed a little. I punch a lot. Fair trade.', 'That {mob} scratched the monk. Big mistake, {mob}.', 'HP below half. My jab is still perfect, though.', 'I am bruised, not beaten. There is a difference.', 'That hit hurt. My next kick will hurt more.', 'I am down to half. That {mob} is nearly dust.', 'My gi is torn. My temper is fully lit.', 'Ouch. That {mob} just signed its own punch card.', 'HP low, chi high, temper higher. Watch out, {mob}.', 'I took a hit. I will return it with interest and fists.', 'Half HP means half the monk to hit. Good luck, {mob}.', 'That {mob} thinks it is winning. Bless its heart.', 'I am bruised and hilarious. A dangerous combo.', 'My health bar is shy. My fists are not.', 'That {mob} drew first blood. I draw last punch.', 'I am at half health and full knuckle capacity.', 'A scratch, a punch, and suddenly that {mob} is sorry.', 'HP dropping fast. Jokes faster. Punches fastest.', 'I am not dying. I am just theatrically half alive.', 'That {mob} hit hard. My roundhouse hits harder.', 'Half HP, all monk, no mercy left in stock.', 'I wobble a bit. My fists do not wobble at all.', 'That bat landed one lucky hit. Only one, ever.', 'My HP is low but my chakra is fully charged.', 'I am hurt, I am grinning, I am still punching.', 'That {mob} wants me floored. I want it flattened.', 'Low HP is just my dramatic entrance to a comeback.', 'I am bleeding and still the funniest one here.', 'That hit stung. The roundhouse will sting more.', 'Half health, zero fear, one very angry monk.', 'My HP bar is small. My kick range is not.', 'I am down but my fists are up. That is what counts.', 'That {mob} made me bleed. Now I make it bruised.