            low = { 'HP low. My lance is still fully loaded, though.', 'I am hurt, but my wyvern is fine. Priorities.', 'Half health, full lance, zero plans to run.', 'That {mob} hit me. Rude. Now it pays in pokes.', 'I am at half HP and twice the wyvern.', 'My HP is dropping. My Jump is rising. Funny.', 'I bleed a little. I poke a lot. Fair trade.', 'That {mob} scratched the dragoon. Big mistake, {mob}.', 'HP below half. My lance aim is still perfect.', 'I am wounded, not grounded. There is a difference.', 'That hit hurt. My next Jump will hurt more.', 'I am down to half. That {mob} is down to pokes.', 'My armor is dented. My temper is fully lit.', 'Ouch. That {mob} just signed its own landing form.', 'HP low, lance high, temper higher. Watch out, {mob}.', 'I took a hit. I will return it with a lance.', 'Half HP means half the dragoon to hit. Good luck.', 'That {mob} thinks it is winning. Adorable. It is wrong.', 'I am hurt and joking. A dangerous combination.', 'My health bar is shy. My wyvern is not.', 'That {mob} drew first blood. I draw last Jump.', 'I am at half health and full wyvern capacity.', 'A scratch, a Jump, and suddenly that {mob} is sorry.', 'HP dropping fast. Jokes faster. Jumps fastest.', 'I am not dying. I am just dramatically half a dragoon.', 'That {mob} hit hard. My landing hits harder.', 'Half HP, all dragoon, no mercy left in stock.', 'I wobble a bit. My wyvern does not wobble at all.', 'That bat got one hit in. One is all it gets.', 'My HP is low but my wyvern is fully charged.', 'I am hurt, I am grinning, I am still jumping.', 'That {mob} wants me down. I want it flat. Deal.', 'Low HP is just my dramatic Jump to winning.', 'I am bleeding and my wyvern is still circling.', 'That hit stung. The lance will sting more.', 'Half health, zero fear, one very angry dragoon.', 'My HP bar is small. My Jump arc is not.', 'I am down but my wyvern is up. That is what counts.', 'That {mob} made me bleed. Now I make it landings.', 'I am hurt, not grounded.