            recover = { 'HP is back. The dragoon is back. {mob} is doomed.', 'I am back up and my lance never left.', 'Back above half. Back to jumping on things.', 'My health returned. My wyvern never left.', 'I feel alive again. That {mob} will not stay up long.', 'HP recovered. Jokes recovered. Jumps reloaded.', 'I am back on my feet and back on the Jump.', 'That was a close one. Now watch my Jump answer.', 'Health is up. Temper is still up. Lance is ready.', 'I am patched up and twice as jumpy now.', 'Back in the green and already planning the next Jump.', 'My HP climbed back. My Jump arc climbed higher.', 'I survived that. My wyvern will not forgive {mob}.', 'Feeling better, jumping better, aiming better.', 'HP restored. The dragoon menace is fully operational.', 'I am back and my wyvern missed the action.', 'That low HP phase is over. The Jump phase begins.', 'My health bar is healthy again. My wyvern is too.', 'I recovered. That {mob} does not get to recover.', 'Back to full power. The Jump count resumes now.', 'I am back, I am happy, I am jumping again.', 'HP is up, lance is up, morale is way up.', 'That was a scare. This next Jump is the answer.', 'I am standing tall again. Tall enough to jump, anyway.', 'Recovery complete. Jump loading. Please wait, {mob}.', 'My HP is back where it belongs: above the {mob}.', 'I feel great. That {mob} is about to feel flattened.', 'Back from the brink, straight to the landing zone.', 'That bat hurt me. I am fine now. It is doomed.', 'Health restored, ego restored, lance recharged.', 'I am good as new. That {mob} is good as flattened.', 'My HP bounced back. My Jumps never bounced at all.', 'I am back in action and the action is airborne.', 'That recovery felt great. The next Jump feels greater.', 'I am whole again. That {mob} is about to be flat.', 'HP is healthy. My wyvern is healthier.', 'I shook that off. My wyvern shook it off too.', 'Back to business: the business of big landings.', 'I am recovered and ready to redecor